  "passage": "Greenfield Community Centre is hosting a leisure fair this Saturday from 10 am to 4 pm. The event aims to be a peaceful gathering for the whole community. Activities will be divided into indoor and outdoor zones, including sports, games, and creative workshops. To prevent any safety issues, we have arranged for volunteers to monitor the areas. Local businesses are welcome to set up stalls to showcase their goods. Food and drinks will be sold by local vendors. The current situation is that we need more helpers for the morning shift, especially at the button-making craft station. Left-hand scissors and tools will be available for those who need them. Please register online or at the centre by Friday to confirm your attendance. We look forward to a fun and relaxing day for everyone. Don't miss this chance to connect with your neighbours.",
